# Build context exclusions for every image built from the repository root.
#
# The server image (src/SlayIdleRepeat.Server/Dockerfile) is built with the REPO
# ROOT as its context, because the Server project needs global.json,
# Directory.Build.props and the whole src/ project graph. Docker reads the
# .dockerignore next to the context, which is why this file lives at the root
# rather than beside the Dockerfile.
#
# Keep this list conservative: anything excluded here that a future image needs
# fails as a confusing "file not found" inside the build, not at COPY time.

# --------------------------------------------------------------- build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/
*.binlog

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ test runs
**/TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

# ------------------------------------------------------------ vcs and agents
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/

# ------------------------------------------------------------- docs, not code
docs/
game-design/
*.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------- IDE and tooling
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln.docstates

# ------------------------------------------------------------- Godot artefacts
.godot/
mono_crash.*.json

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
